    "sections": {
        "description": "Build Kit is a modern WordPress theme for construction companies, contractors and agencies. The theme features responsive design, project showcases, service/team sections, testimonials, and portfolio grids. Built for speed, SEO, and customization with Elementor page builder. Includes pre-built demos, contact forms and WooCommerce compatibility. Ideal for builders, architects, and industrial professionals. You can easily customize the header, footer and blog layout with live editors."
